{"strongs": "H5166", "word": "נְחֶמְיָה", "translit": "ne.chem.yah", "root": "נחל", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "Yah comforts", "definition": "נְחֶמְיָה proper name, masculine ( Yah comforts , ᵐ5 Νεεμιας ( ‐ου ), etc.; — proper name נחמיה(וׅ on Israel scarab in BM, ClGann Jas 1883, Fév.-Mars. 156 No. 42 ); — 1. the son of Hachaliah, governor of Judah under Artaxerxes Longimanus Neh 1:1 ; Neh 8:9 ; Neh 10:2 ; Neh 12:26 ; Neh 12:47 . 2. ruler of half the district of Bethzur Neh 3:16 . 3. one of twelve heads of people who returned with Zerubbabel Ezra 2:2 = Neh 7:7 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5122')\">BDB5122</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5166')\">H5166</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5121')\">BDB5121</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5123')\">BDB5123</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>נְחֶמְיָה</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (<highlight>Yah comforts</highlight>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Νεεμιας</grk>(<grk>‐ου</grk>), etc.; — proper name <bdbheb>נחמיה(וׅ</bdbheb> on Israel scarab in BM, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('ClGann')\">ClGann<sup>Jas 1883, Fév.-Mars. 156 No. 42</sup></lookup>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> the son of Hachaliah, governor of Judah under Artaxerxes Longimanus <ref ref=\"Neh 1:1\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(16,1,1)\">Neh 1:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 8:9\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(16,8,9)\">Neh 8:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 10:2\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(16,10,2)\">Neh 10:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 12:26\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,26)\">Neh 12:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 12:47\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"47\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"47\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,47)\">Neh 12:47</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> ruler of half the district of Bethzur <ref ref=\"Neh 3:16\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,16)\">Neh 3:16</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> one of twelve heads of people who returned with Zerubbabel <ref ref=\"Ezra 2:2\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(15,2,2)\">Ezra 2:2</ref> = <ref ref=\"Neh 7:7\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(16,7,7)\">Neh 7:7</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Neh 1:1", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 1, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Neh 8:9", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 8, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Neh 10:2", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 10, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Neh 12:26", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 12, "verse": 26}, {"raw": "Neh 12:47", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 12, "verse": 47}, {"raw": "Neh 3:16", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 3, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Ezra 2:2", "book": "EZR", "chapter": 2, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Neh 7:7", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 7, "verse": 7}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["נְחֶמְיָה", "ᵐ5", "נחמיה(וׅ"], "aramaic": [], "greek": ["Νεεμιας", "‐ου"], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["ClGann", "Sept"]}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB5122", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}